            {
                "entry_id": "50f24340-5065-39e3-856d-6bcd25a1f402",
                "word": "winkle",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "de5746df-1f0d-43e6-aa61-c08c05a793c8",
                        "entry_id": "50f24340-5065-39e3-856d-6bcd25a1f402",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "winkles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "75f03d84-5df4-3d37-bff9-7f589fe40eb6",
                        "entry_id": "50f24340-5065-39e3-856d-6bcd25a1f402",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A periwinkle or its shell, of family Littorinidae."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "059b78d3-13f5-4f98-9979-bbcc62c042b4",
                                "sense_id": "75f03d84-5df4-3d37-bff9-7f589fe40eb6",
                                "text": "[…] because the inward Eare is intorted like a winkle-shell, and hangeth as a bell in thee steeple of the body, it easily perceiueth all appulsions of the Ayre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6ae87ed-0d4b-4405-9799-ee0a8dd74ec7",
                                "sense_id": "75f03d84-5df4-3d37-bff9-7f589fe40eb6",
                                "text": "Shrimps and winkles are the staple commodities of the afternoon trade, which lasts from three to half-past five in the evening. These articles are generally bought by the working-classes for their tea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3ce583a-0046-4736-84e8-59e25810e8bf",
                                "sense_id": "75f03d84-5df4-3d37-bff9-7f589fe40eb6",
                                "text": "Sometimes late at night men would come in with a pail of winkles they had bought cheap, and share them out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e9e0d7d-d644-4118-a2f2-9e2731a5a2b7",
                                "sense_id": "75f03d84-5df4-3d37-bff9-7f589fe40eb6",
                                "text": "Briony was on her knees, trying to put her arms round Lola and gather her to her, but the body was bony and unyielding, wrapped tight about itself like a seashell. A winkle."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8dd47fe0-2700-3ef9-b9bc-18121d2a67f9",
                        "entry_id": "50f24340-5065-39e3-856d-6bcd25a1f402",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any one of various marine spiral gastropods, especially, in the United States, either of two species Busycotypus canaliculatus or Busycon carica."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b23308a5-93ac-4c94-b9ec-61f4df251f44",
                                "sense_id": "8dd47fe0-2700-3ef9-b9bc-18121d2a67f9",
                                "text": "There were also found fragments of the winkle (Fulgar carica)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7c1bd97-aff1-47b3-b72a-f025984a6321",
                                "sense_id": "8dd47fe0-2700-3ef9-b9bc-18121d2a67f9",
                                "text": "The conchs or winkles, Busycon carica (fig. 204, opp. p. 216) and B. canaliculata, ... He gave the estimate of one planter who believed that one winkle was able to destroy a bushel of oysters in a single hour."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cd01eb6-9b6b-4610-b46e-16897d24b059",
                                "sense_id": "8dd47fe0-2700-3ef9-b9bc-18121d2a67f9",
                                "text": "In Connecticut, the so-called \"winkle\" chowder is made from B. [Busycon] canaliculatum."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b2872120-46b4-3c65-975b-bbdb3c51ea9d",
                        "entry_id": "50f24340-5065-39e3-856d-6bcd25a1f402",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The penis, especially that of a child rather than that of an adult."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "childish",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e370365-ff0f-48d3-b34c-29458e3e1282",
                                "sense_id": "b2872120-46b4-3c65-975b-bbdb3c51ea9d",
                                "text": "After all, he didn't want his winkle to get so big it became unruly and unnatural."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce3f392b-40a0-43bf-aea1-6968a495d31e",
                        "source_entry_id": "50f24340-5065-39e3-856d-6bcd25a1f402",
                        "source_sense_description": "children's slang: the penis",
                        "target_lang_word": "zizi",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zizi",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27b6ff1f-4b1d-33eb-9fe7-3f0ecd1beafa",
                                        "entry_id": "d8a28139-3ef2-3bf8-b1f5-8abae376d19c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pénis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f6e89c9-c0cc-4598-b693-106540a6756f",
                                                "sense_id": "27b6ff1f-4b1d-33eb-9fe7-3f0ecd1beafa",
                                                "text": "Des zizis y’en a d’toutes les couleurs\nÔ gué, ô gué\nDes boulangers jusqu’aux ramoneurs\nÔ gué, ô gué\nJ’en ai vu des impulsifs\nQui grimpaient dans les calcifs\nJ’en ai vu de moins voraces\nTomber dans les godasses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0defa69-1e8f-4532-9f2e-4a5d15507fad",
                                                "sense_id": "27b6ff1f-4b1d-33eb-9fe7-3f0ecd1beafa",
                                                "text": "Tu veux mon zizi ? oui oui oui oui\nJe vais te le donner, oui oui oui oui"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22c43cb9-6661-47c6-9462-71cb28ba42c5",
                                                "sense_id": "27b6ff1f-4b1d-33eb-9fe7-3f0ecd1beafa",
                                                "text": "Elle proposa à Solange de la suivre, déroula une serviette de toilette sur le lit de ses parents, allongea Tom sur le linge. Elle nettoya ses fesses, le pli des cuisses, le zizi, puis les sécha avec application."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "068fcd11-bf35-4c24-b114-4803e17dd914",
                                                "sense_id": "27b6ff1f-4b1d-33eb-9fe7-3f0ecd1beafa",
                                                "text": "Le petit zizi fait donc partie intégrante de l’idéal esthétique de l’époque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a483d58-854c-3b60-ab44-d0659b7a893b",
                                        "entry_id": "d8a28139-3ef2-3bf8-b1f5-8abae376d19c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Garçon falot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4e6876a-9f2b-4339-a84b-069e3b9fd9e5",
                                                "sense_id": "5a483d58-854c-3b60-ab44-d0659b7a893b",
                                                "text": "Que les hommes nous appellent nanas ou boudins, humiliant, mais je n’étais pas très nette du côté vocabulaire moi non plus, les garçons, je les divisais souvent en minus, zigotos et zizis, dont avec Hilda j’ignorais le sens obscène. Bien obligée d’avouer que le zizi était le pendant de boudin, un type falot, sans valeur flirtable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "zizi",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4410c58-947a-3437-aae4-78c96c3a13ae",
                                        "entry_id": "2d0f49ad-333f-3429-aabf-055af3f078ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonyme de bruant zizi (oiseau)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54a3580f-4254-41c6-807d-4621a8b840ed",
                                                "sense_id": "a4410c58-947a-3437-aae4-78c96c3a13ae",
                                                "text": "Buffon a écrit très sérieusement dans son Histoire naturelle : « Je donne à cet oiseau le nom de zizi d’après son cri ordinaire », sans se douter qu’aujourd’hui ce nom prêterait à sourire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
